            "text": "Mina took an umbrella because dark clouds were moving toward the park.",
            "isKey": true,
            "misconception": null,
            "rationale": "This sentence clearly shows that the dark clouds were the reason Mina took an umbrella."
          },
          {
            "text": "Mina took an umbrella although dark clouds were moving toward the park.",
